<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email - Shohoj Hishab</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1f2937;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #ea580c 50%, #c2410c 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        
        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 
                0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25),
                0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        .header-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #ea580c 100%);
            padding: 40px 40px 60px;
            position: relative;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .header-banner::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -20px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 40px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
        }
        
        .logo-circle {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        
        .logo-circle svg {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
        }
        
        .brand-name {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        
        .brand-tagline {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        
        .content-section {
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .verification-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fde68a 100%);
            color: #92400e;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        .verification-badge svg {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
        }
        
        .greeting {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .description {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        
        .button-wrapper {
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        
        .verify-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #ea580c 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            box-shadow: 
                0 10px 15px -3px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3),
                0 4px 6px -2px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .verify-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 
                0 20px 25px -5px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35),
                0 10px 10px -5px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2);
        }
        
        .divider {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin: 32px 0;
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .divider::before,
        .divider::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: #e5e7eb;
        }
        
        .fallback-link {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .fallback-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .fallback-url {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #f97316;
            word-break: break-all;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .security-notice {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-top: 32px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .security-notice-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: #dc2626;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .security-notice-text {
            color: #991b1b;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .footer-section {
            background: #f9fafb;
            padding: 32px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .footer-text {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .footer-brand {
            color: #f97316;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .footer-address {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        
        @media only screen and (max-width: 540px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 16px;
            }
            
            .header-banner {
                padding: 32px 24px 50px;
            }
            
            .content-section {
                padding: 32px 24px;
            }
            
            .footer-section {
                padding: 24px;
            }
            
            .greeting {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-container">
            <div class="header-banner">
                <div class="logo-circle">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M3 3V21H21" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        <path d="M7 14L12 9L16 13L21 8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="brand-name">Shohoj Hishab</div>
                <div class="brand-tagline">সহজ হিসাব | Smart POS System</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="content-section">
                <div class="verification-badge">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.267 3.455a3.066 3.066 0 001.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 013.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 001.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 012.812 2.812c.051.643.304 1.254.723 1.745a3.066 3.066 0 010 3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723 1.745 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812 2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-3.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812-2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 010-3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 012.812-2.812zm7.44 5.252a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
                    </svg>
                    Verify Your Email
                </div>
                
                <h1 class="greeting">Hello {{displayName}}! 👋</h1>
                
                <p class="description">
                    Welcome to <strong>Shohoj Hishab</strong>! We're excited to have you on board. 
                    Please verify your email address to get started with your smart POS experience.
                </p>
                
                <div class="button-wrapper">
                    <a href="{{verificationLink}}" class="verify-button">
                        Verify Email Now
                    </a>
                </div>
                
                <div class="divider">or copy this link</div>
                
                <div class="fallback-link">
                    <span class="fallback-label">Verification Link:</span>
                    <span class="fallback-url">{{verificationLink}}</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="security-notice">
                    <div class="security-notice-title">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.257 3.099c.765-1.36 2.722-1.36 3.486 0l5.58 9.92c.75 1.334-.213 2.98-1.742 2.98H4.42c-1.53 0-2.493-1.646-1.743-2.98l5.58-9.92zM11 13a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-8a1 1 0 00-1 1v3a1 1 0 002 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
                        </svg>
                        Security Notice
                    </div>
                    <p class="security-notice-text">
                        This verification link will expire in <strong>24 hours</strong>. 
                        If you didn't create an account, please ignore this email.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="footer-section">
                <p class="footer-text">
                    © 2026 <span class="footer-brand">Shohoj Hishab</span>. All rights reserved.
                </p>
                <p class="footer-address">Banani, Dhaka-1213, Bangladesh</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
